    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Animation Sketchpad </h2>An extremely fast hand-drawn animation app for desktop using a tablet for thick and thin brush control and intuitive workflow.<br>Designed by an animator, for animators with a focus on keyboard shortcuts and pen tablet as the main tools.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724880/extras/2b972b219985df63e14f9bb99fa8e8c3.poster.avif?t=1656996365\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724880/extras/2b972b219985df63e14f9bb99fa8e8c3.webm?t=1656996365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724880/extras/2b972b219985df63e14f9bb99fa8e8c3.mp4?t=1656996365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fast Animation Workflow</h2>Features like layers, color fill below line, layout and background functionality and MP4 import/export makes this an ideal tool for artists and animators across all skill levels.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724880/extras/20190f0b6ce33d4a3dceb2571a49cec6.poster.avif?t=1656996365\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724880/extras/20190f0b6ce33d4a3dceb2571a49cec6.webm?t=1656996365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724880/extras/20190f0b6ce33d4a3dceb2571a49cec6.mp4?t=1656996365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724880/extras/a8d3eade71d0fa63193c5cde81bd68ed.poster.avif?t=1656996365\" ><source src=\"https://s